symbol Measure
lines 0 2
hash 668703b9a4884e82
note All the ui crate wants to know about fonts: the cell width and row height at one pixel size. Layout, text measurement and the canvas's pen all go through it. The platform's Renderer implements it from the real font; the ui tests implement it with a fixed 8x16 cell, which is how the layout and the draw list are testable with no GPU.

