symbol Command
lines 0 26
hash c75537f39962030a
note The primitives, all in window pixels. Clip carries the absolute clip rectangle already intersected with the ones outside it, so the replayer only sets it. Fill is an axis-aligned rectangle, Quad any four corners (a line segment arrives as one), Circle a filled disc, Text a run of one-colour text at a font size with its top-left at a point, and Grid a shared block of coloured cells drawn a cell and a row apart - the drawn form of every code view, shared by Rc so a big file costs nothing to put in the list twice.

