file crates/ui/src/canvas.rs
symbol push_clip
lines 0 4
hash 0e311612c53dd2f3
note A clip is intersected with the current one, so a nested clip can only ever shrink, and the intersection is emitted as a Clip command. The replayer therefore never needs a stack of its own.

